item_id = "item_002"
item_name = "Glass Shard"
description = "A sharp fragment of broken glass that still reflects light despite its rough edges.

Though seemingly worthless on its own, its clean surface and jagged shape make it a useful crafting material.

Skilled artisans and researchers often collect Glass Shards to create lenses, decorative objects, or experimental equipment."
